#### 链接参数说明

```
https://{SHARE_BILL_DOMIAN}/?dbid=1713342253234469311&prod_url=tf-ek.jdy.com&bill_type=kdst_with_accounting_bill&from_type=APP&basedata/get_custom_field=2098054100552922112&basedata/bill_field_config_info=2098054100922019840&basedata/user_field_perm_list=2098054101240787968&sal/load_system_param_v2=2098054101567942656&kdst_junior/kdst_with_accounting_billdetail=2098056234480583680&kdst_junior/kdst_with_accounting_bill=2098056234656746496&ek/coustombill/router=2098054102549410816

链接中的参数解析

{SHARE_BILL_DOMIAN}：分享链接域名是customHashMap中ShareConstant.SHARE_BILL_DOMIAN对应的value

dbid：账套ID

prod_url: 接口请求拿值的具体域名

bill_type:单据编码

basedata/get_custom_field：自定义字段参数（默认路由，不用可删除）路由入参为 2098054100552922112

basedata/bill_field_config_info：移动用户列设置（默认路由，不用可删除）路由入参为 2098054100922019840

basedata/user_field_perm_list：字段权限（默认路由，不用可删除）路由入参为2098054101240787968

sal/load_system_param_v2：公共参数-读取是否开启脱敏（默认路由，不用可删除）路由入参为2098054101567942656

kdst_junior/kdst_with_accounting_billdetail：自定义路由(必须是已发布的接口)，是在插件com.jdy.cmbc.formplugin.testBillShare中的objectObjectmap配置

objectObjectmap中的key为kdst_junior/kdst_with_accounting_billdetail，入参objectObjectmap中的value转码为2098056234480583680

kdst_junior/kdst_with_accounting_bill:自定义路由(必须是已发布的接口),路由入参为2098056234656746496
